<title>UK: Ekofisk Dec programme up at 14.7 mln barrels.</title>
<headline>Ekofisk Dec programme up at 14.7 mln barrels.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's Ekofisk crude oil pipeline system is due to load 14.7 million barrels in December, up from 13.8 million barrels in November, traders said on Friday.  </p>
<p>The December programme will consist of 12 cargoes of 600,000 barrels each, a further 14 cargoes of 500,000 barrels and one 570,000 barrel cargo. This gives a total of 27 cargoes for the month.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4185</p>
</text>
